## ordered_country_strategic_region
Iterate through all strategic regions containing states owned by the scoped country  
ordered_country_strategic_region = {  
limit = { <triggers> }  
order_by = script_value  
position = int  
min = int  
max = script_value  
check_range_bounds = no # If you don't want an error logged if the list is smaller than the min/max  
<effects> }
**Supported Scopes**: country  
**Supported Targets**: strategic_region  

